; pdsmerge.msg %I% -- message strings for PDSMERGE
;
; The format is:
;
;	<number><space><string><newline>
;
; Where:
;	<number>	identifies the string
;	<space>		is a separator, and is discarded
;	<string>	is the string that will be used
;	<newline>	separates "records", and is discarded
;
; A line beginning with ';' is ignored
;
